\`\`\`text
/api/admin/products/bulk-import-v2
\`\`\`

- \`server.js\` now has a reliable v2 import endpoint returning:

\`\`\`json
{
  "received": 2,
  "created": 0,
  "updated": 2,
  "skipped": 0
}
\`\`\`

If a product already exists by name, it is updated instead of duplicated.
`);

